{"seq":2,"slug":"contrastive-generative-objectives","title":"对比学习与生成式目标的训练机制权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/pretraining-alignment/contrastive-generative-objectives","wordCount":2855,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"对比学习与生成式目标的训练机制权衡\">对比学习与生成式目标的训练机制权衡</h1><p>多模态模型的能力边界，一半写在数据配方里，另一半写在损失函数里。同样规模、同样数据的两个模型，一个用对比目标训练，能零样本分类却画不出一张图；另一个用生成目标训练，能逐像素重建图像却在检索任务上表现平平。这种「同一架构、不同命运」的分裂，根源不在参数或数据，而在于预训练目标定义了模型到底在优化什么。本页拆解对比目标与生成目标的机制差异、各自付出的代价，以及在统一模型里把两者组合时所触发的真实张力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两个目标家族的分歧可以归结为一个问题：模型该学「表示」还是学「分布」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对比目标</strong>（contrastive）学的是表示空间。它把匹配的图文对拉近、把不匹配的对推远，输出的是一个嵌入向量，下游用余弦相似度即可完成检索与零样本分类。CLIP 用四亿对数据把这一范式确立为多模态预训练的主流（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.00020\">CLIP</a>），其目标函数即 InfoNCE：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>con</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{con}} = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\log\\frac{\\exp(\\text{sim}(v_i,t_i)/\\tau)}{\\sum_{j=1}^{N}\\exp(\\text{sim}(v_i,t_j)/\\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">con</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1354em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为余弦相似度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 为可学习的温度，分母里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 遍历同一批次内的所有文本。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成目标</strong>（generative）学的是条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x \\mid c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。给定文本条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，模型直接建模图像（或其离散 token 序列）的似然，因此天生具备「造出样本」的能力。文本侧的标准形式是自回归负对数似然：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>ar</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{ar}} = -\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log p_\\theta(x_t \\mid x_{&lt;t}, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ar</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;配对 / 交错多模态数据&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;预训练目标选择&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|对比| C[&quot;双塔编码器&lt;br/&gt;InfoNCE&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;共享嵌入空间&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;检索 / 零样本分类&lt;br/&gt;无法生成&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|生成| F[&quot;统一 Transformer&lt;br/&gt;离散 token 或连续潜变量&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;条件似然 / 去噪&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;图像与视频生成&lt;br/&gt;表示能力弱&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|混合| I[&quot;加性组合或双路径解耦&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;理解与生成并存&lt;br/&gt;梯度冲突风险&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"配对 / 交错多模态数据\"] --&gt; B{\"预训练目标选择\"}\n    B --&gt;|对比| C[\"双塔编码器&lt;br/&gt;InfoNCE\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"共享嵌入空间\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"检索 / 零样本分类&lt;br/&gt;无法生成\"]\n    B --&gt;|生成| F[\"统一 Transformer&lt;br/&gt;离散 token 或连续潜变量\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"条件似然 / 去噪\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"图像与视频生成&lt;br/&gt;表示能力弱\"]\n    B --&gt;|混合| I[\"加性组合或双路径解耦\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"理解与生成并存&lt;br/&gt;梯度冲突风险\"]</pre><p>两者的关键差异可归纳为下表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>对比目标</th>\n<th>生成目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优化对象</td>\n<td>表示空间的相对距离</td>\n<td>样本的绝对似然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出形态</td>\n<td>嵌入向量</td>\n<td>图像 / token 序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监督密度</td>\n<td>弱（一对一个正样本）</td>\n<td>强（每个 token/像素都是监督）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件瓶颈</td>\n<td>批次大小（负样本量）</td>\n<td>序列长度与解码步数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天然擅长</td>\n<td>检索、零样本分类</td>\n<td>图像/视频合成、编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型失败模式</td>\n<td>模态鸿沟、批次依赖</td>\n<td>表示退化、训练不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解这张表，就理解了为什么「统一模型」在实践中总要面对取舍，而非简单地把两个损失相加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对比目标的机制与规模依赖\">对比目标的机制与规模依赖</h2><p>InfoNCE 的分母决定了它对批次大小的强依赖。批内每个非配对样本都充当负样本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span></span></span></span></span> 项在数值上会被最大的负样本主导，因此批次越大、负样本越多样，梯度估计越接近真实分布的对比信号。CLIP 与 ALIGN 都在数千至上万的批次上训练，ALIGN 用十八亿对嘈杂图文证明「数据规模可以弥补标注质量」（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2102.04306\">ALIGN</a>），代价正是把全局归一化跨设备展开所带来的通信开销。</p>\n<p>SigLIP 直接改写了这一点：它把 softmax 换成逐对独立的 sigmoid 损失，每个配对只需判断「是/否匹配」，不再需要跨批次归一化（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.15343\">SigLIP</a>）。这一改动让小批次也能训练、免去全局 gather，成为 2024 年之后多数视觉编码器的默认选择。其后继 SigLIP 2 在同一骨架上引入解码器与自蒸馏，把语义理解、定位与多语言能力一并补齐（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.14786\">SigLIP 2</a>）。</p>\n<p>对比目标有一个被反复观测到的结构性问题：<strong>模态鸿沟</strong>（modality gap）——即使训练收敛，图像嵌入与文本嵌入仍分别聚集在向量空间的两个锥形区域，而非完全重合（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.09139\">Mind the Gap</a>）。这不是训练不足，而是对比损失本身对模态间整体偏移不敏感的结果，它直接影响零样本迁移与图文插值类任务的表现。</p>\n<p>更根本的限制是能力上限：对比目标只定义相对距离，不定义如何从文本「还原」出一张图。它可以判断哪张图配哪句话，却不能画出一张符合描述的图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生成目标的三条技术路线\">生成目标的三条技术路线</h2><p>生成目标内部并非铁板一块，落地时主要有三条路线，各自把代价放在了不同位置。</p>\n<p><strong>离散 token 自回归。</strong> 先用 VQ-VAE 类量化器把图像编码成离散码本 token，再让 Transformer 像处理文本一样做 next-token prediction。Emu3 证明纯 token 路线可以同时覆盖图像、视频与文本生成（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.18869\">Emu3</a>），Chameleon 则把这一思路做成 early-fusion 的混合模态模型，但公开了训练不稳定问题，需要用 QK-norm、dropout 与 logit 归一化项来压制 logits 爆炸（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.09818\">Chameleon</a>）。这条路线最大的吸引力是把视觉与文本统一成同一套 token 接口，缺点是量化器本身有信息损失，且需要独立训练一个高质量 tokenizer。</p>\n<p><strong>连续潜变量扩散 / 流匹配。</strong> 直接在高维连续潜空间上建模去噪过程，Diffusion 用逐步加噪-去噪定义似然（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239\">DDPM</a>），流匹配与 rectified flow 则学习把噪声分布沿直线轨迹搬运到数据分布，训练更稳、采样步数更少（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02747\">Flow Matching</a>）。这类目标生成质量高、细节好，但模型里没有一个天然为检索设计的嵌入。</p>\n<p><strong>单 Transformer 内的双目标混合。</strong> Transfusion 用一个 Transformer 同时承担文本的 next-token prediction 与图像的扩散去噪，在交错数据上训练，报告称 7B 规模即可对标同等生成质量的 Chameleon，而算力消耗显著更低（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.11039\">Transfusion</a>）。它说明两个目标可以在同一组参数里共存，只要各自作用在合适的 token 上。</p>\n<p>用文字追问「生成目标会不会损害理解能力」时，答案通常是会——只是程度取决于如何接线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合目标的组合方式与表征退化\">混合目标的组合方式与表征退化</h2><p>把两个目标放进一个模型，有三条工程路线，复杂度递增。</p>\n<p><strong>加性组合。</strong> CoCa 让同一个视觉编码器同时接对比头与生成（captioning）头，一个编码器既产出对齐嵌入又驱动解码器，两个损失按权重相加（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.01917\">CoCa</a>）。FLAVA、BLIP 走的是类似的多任务联合路线（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.04482\">FLAVA</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.12086\">BLIP</a>）。简单直接，但两个目标的梯度方向并不总是一致：对比项要求表示对细节不敏感（关注语义整体），生成项却要求表示保留重建所需的全部细节，冲突梯度会互相削弱。</p>\n<p><strong>共享编码、双路径解码。</strong> Janus 系列把视觉编码器按用途拆开：理解路径用高语义编码器，生成路径用另一套支撑重建的编码，避免一个编码器被两个目标同时拉扯；Janus-Pro 在此之上放大规模并改进训练配方（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.17811\">Janus-Pro</a>）。代价是参数与显存翻倍。</p>\n<p><strong>完全统一为单一路径。</strong> 最激进，也最容易撞上<strong>表示退化</strong>：用自回归式图像生成目标训练的统一模型，其内部表示对判别式任务往往不如纯对比或纯理解模型。xGen-MM（BLIP-3）在开源交错数据配方中明确指出，交错生成训练对理解能力的增益有限，统一模型的理解指标普遍落后于同规模专用模型（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.08872\">xGen-MM</a>）。这也解释了为什么直到 2025 年，「统一」更多是研究议题，而生产系统仍倾向理解与生成分模型部署。</p>\n<p>实操中还有两个常被低估的细节。其一是<strong>分辨率与 token 预算的错配</strong>：生成目标在高分辨率上消耗的 token 是理解的数倍，混合训练时如果按样本平均损失，生成项会主导梯度。其二是<strong>目标权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的调度</strong>：恒定权重在训练早期让生成项压垮对比项，常见做法是先在对比或理解任务上预热，再逐步引入生成项，并对其学习率单独调低。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>con</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>gen</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 随训练步数递增</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{total}} = \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{con}} + \\lambda(t)\\,\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{gen}}, \\qquad \\lambda(t)\\ \\text{随训练步数递增}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">con</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gen</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">随训练步数递增</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"目标选择的决策依据\">目标选择的决策依据</h2><p>把上面的机制落到选型上，问题不是「哪个目标更好」，而是「这个模型的消费方是谁」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>首选目标</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n<th>需要接受的成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图文检索 / 零样本分类</td>\n<td>对比（SigLIP 式 sigmoid）</td>\n<td>嵌入天然可比，免全局归一化</td>\n<td>无生成能力，模态鸿沟需后处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像/视频生成、编辑</td>\n<td>扩散 / 流匹配</td>\n<td>细节与条件控制最强</td>\n<td>无检索嵌入，推理多步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一多模态对话 + 生成</td>\n<td>双路径解耦（Janus 式）</td>\n<td>理解与生成互不拉扯</td>\n<td>参数量翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极致参数效率的统一</td>\n<td>单路径 token 自回归</td>\n<td>一套接口覆盖全模态</td>\n<td>训练不稳定、表示退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>既要对比又要生成头</td>\n<td>加性组合（CoCa 式）</td>\n<td>复用同一编码器</td>\n<td>梯度冲突、需权重调优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条可操作的经验法则是：如果下游是检索、排序、聚类这类「比较」任务，对比目标是正确起点；如果下游是内容生产、数据增强、编辑，生成目标是正确起点；只有当产品同时要求两者且无法拆成两个模型时，才值得承担混合目标的复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关于数据与目标的耦合\">关于数据与目标的耦合</h2><p>目标函数不是孤立的选择——它反过来决定了数据该怎么策展。对比目标对错配的负样本极度敏感，一条错配的配对在分母里充当被误标的正样本，直接拉低可达性能；生成目标则更依赖字幕的信息密度，稀薄的 alt-text 无法提供足够的条件信号。因此「用了什么目标」会倒逼「用了什么数据配方」，两者的关系见同章节的 <a href=\"multimodal-data-mixture-curation\">图文/视频对的配比、去重与数据策展</a>。架构侧的选择——统一还是模块化——同样与目标强相关，可对照 <a href=\"../multimodal-architecture-representation/unified-vs-modular-architectures\">统一架构与模块化架构</a> 阅读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>对比目标学表示空间、生成目标学条件分布，这一定位差异决定了二者天然擅长检索还是合成。</li>\n<li>InfoNCE 强依赖批次大小，SigLIP 的 sigmoid 损失改写了这一约束；模态鸿沟是对比损失的固有副产品，而非训练不足。</li>\n<li>生成目标的三条路线（离散 token 自回归、连续扩散/流匹配、单 Transformer 双目标混合）把代价分别放在量化损失、推理步数与训练稳定性上。</li>\n<li>混合目标有三档复杂度：加性组合、双路径解耦、完全统一；越靠后越容易触发表示退化，统一模型的理解指标通常落后于专用模型。</li>\n<li>选型取决于消费方：比较类任务选对比，生产类任务选生成，只有产品同时要求两者且无法拆分时才承担混合成本。</li>\n<li>目标与数据配方强耦合——对比目标怕错配，生成目标怕字幕稀薄，二者必须一起设计。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"对比学习与生成式目标的训练机制权衡","id":"对比学习与生成式目标的训练机制权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对比目标的机制与规模依赖","id":"对比目标的机制与规模依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"生成目标的三条技术路线","id":"生成目标的三条技术路线"},{"level":2,"text":"混合目标的组合方式与表征退化","id":"混合目标的组合方式与表征退化"},{"level":2,"text":"目标选择的决策依据","id":"目标选择的决策依据"},{"level":2,"text":"关于数据与目标的耦合","id":"关于数据与目标的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图文/视频对的配比、去重与数据策展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/pretraining-alignment/multimodal-data-mixture-curation"},"next":{"title":"多模态指令微调与模态对齐（模态鸿沟消解）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/multimodal-foundation-model-systems/pretraining-alignment/instruction-tuning-modality-alignment"}}